Subject: [PATCH] the 2026-11-06 improve-scan's exact units on 2 x DGX Spark (both ranks)

On top of 0059 (the bundle-9 tree), three changes a read-only scan of the served engine found (bundle 10): the
Responses route grows a streamed item's text and arguments in place instead of copying the whole text per delta (a think
at the budget held about 0.66 GB a stream); a stream whose copy ahead holds asks the drafter for no drafts (the next
window took the copy and dropped them); the follower ends the pair when a kept state's restore or a prompt's image rows
fail on it (rank 0 went on with a different state, wrong tokens and no error). CPU-tested with red copies, source-
reviewed, and A/B-checked on the pair: 92/92 replies exact against bundle 9, no decode regression
(research/LOCAL-STACK-20261106.md, "Bundle 10"). Generated with `git diff --binary` in a checkout of the 0059 tree;
`git apply` of it gives the served source file for file (1286 files, sha256-compared).

